1
00:05:06,315 --> 00:05:12,315
What are you afraid of? It's only rock & roll.

2
00:10:12,631 --> 00:10:18,631
Trick or Treat is a horror, comedy, music film directed by Charles Martin Smith.

3
00:15:18,947 --> 00:15:24,947
Eddie Weinbauer, a metalhead teen who is bullied at school, looks to his
heavy metal superstar idol, Sammi Curr, for guidance.

4
00:20:25,263 --> 00:20:31,263
When Curr is killed in a hotel fire, Eddie becomes the recipient of the only copy of Curr's
unreleased album, which, when played backwards, brings Sammi back to life.

5
00:25:31,578 --> 00:25:37,578
As Halloween approaches, Eddie begins to realize that this
isn't only rock 'n roll...it's life and death.

6
00:30:37,894 --> 00:30:43,894
Eddie Weinbauer, played by Marc Price.

7
00:35:44,210 --> 00:35:50,210
Sammi Curr, played by Tony Fields.

8
00:40:50,526 --> 00:40:56,526
Leslie Graham, played by Lisa Orgolini.

9
00:45:56,842 --> 00:46:02,842
Tim Hainey, played by Doug Savant.

10
00:51:03,157 --> 00:51:09,157
Angie Weinbauer, played by Elaine Joyce.

11
00:56:09,473 --> 00:56:15,473
Roger Mockus, played by Glen Morgan.

12
01:01:15,789 --> 01:01:21,789
Trick or Treat is a 1986 American supernatural horror film  directed by Charles Martin Smith in his
directorial debut, and produced and released by De Laurentiis Entertainment Group.

13
01:06:22,105 --> 01:06:28,105
It stars Marc Price and Tony Fields, with special appearances by
Gene Simmons and Ozzy Osbourne in his film debut.

14
01:11:28,421 --> 01:11:34,421
The plot centers on an outcast metalhead teenager who is
haunted by the ghost of his rock hero.

15
01:16:34,736 --> 01:16:40,736
It was released on October 24, 1986.

16
01:21:41,052 --> 01:21:47,052
Despite receiving initially middling reviews, Trick or
Treat has developed a cult following.

17
01:26:47,368 --> 01:26:53,368
The film explores themes of rock 'n' roll, rock star, halloween, heavy metal.

18
01:31:53,684 --> 01:31:59,684
The tone is lighthearted and dark.
